    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553-a2">

                <pb facs="0925" n="855" xml:id="pg855"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure
                    1.—Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Dr. Pflaum to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Consul</hi>: Having visited a Turk I asked to be
                    paid, but as he refused to comply there was a disagreement between us. The
                    kaimakam, without fulfilling the necessary formalities according to the treaties
                    and the laws of the country, ordered my imprisonment. Please defend me.</p>
                <closer><signed>DR. PFLAUM.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Axar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1883-04-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 28, 1883</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
